<title>USA: NYSE suspends Sinter Metals, to delist.</title>
<headline>NYSE suspends Sinter Metals, to delist.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that trading in Sinter Metals Inc Class A common will be suspended immediately.</p>
<p>Application will be made to delist the issue, the exchange said.</p>
<p>As a result of the completion of a tender offer by GKN Plc which expired May 30 fewer than 600,000 shares of Sinter's common remain publicly held, the Big Board explained.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
